A||||11||ROB MAC||Fire-O!||||4||
Z||000000||ROB MAC||03-19-2000||06:43 PM||||Driving down the 401 (near Toronto) in semi-heavy traffic, a large empty cement bag was blowing around the highway and I couldn't avoid it, without causing an accident.  It went under the car and glancing in my rear-view, I didn't see it come out.  After another mile or so, I noticed what looked like orange fire-flies flickering through the rear window.  I finally had a chance to pull over and when I looked under the car, there was the bag totally engulfed in flames, jammed under the gas tank.  My first instinct was to run, but I couldn't stand to see my Fiero melt before my eyes.  I crawled under and grabbed it with my bare hands, pulled it out and stomped out the fire.  Took about 1/2 hour for the adrenaline rush to fade.  Since then, I always make sure that what goes in must come out!||||reg||4
Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||03-19-2000||06:48 PM||||Whew! Close one.||||reg||1
Z||000002||geyser||03-20-2000||12:47 AM||||Time to invest in a fire extinguisher.||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||03-20-2000||07:27 AM||||yes, fire extinguishers are cheap compared to the cost of another fiero!||||reg||4
Z||000005||ChadMan||03-20-2000||08:28 AM||||There will be those who say you were foolish to risk your personal safety to save your car.  Bullspit!  I hereby present you with the first annual Cliff Pennock Commemorative Award for your courageous act of valor and for saving your Fiero from cremation.<P>(Award has no actual cash value.  Dealer contribution may affect consumer cost.  Some restrictions apply.)||||reg||14
Z||000006||87ECO5||03-20-2000||08:29 AM||||I may get <B>flamed</B> for this but I'd be pretty <B>hot</B> at the idiot that allowed that thing to get onto the highway! I mean, what were they <B>smoking</B> anyway!? The person should be <B>fire</B>d!<P>Kinda gives a new meaning to the phrase "<B>burning rubber</B>"!!!<P>Oh well, I better <B>bag</B> this joke before I'm raked over the <B>coals</B>! <P>Seriously though, I'm glad nobody was hurt.||||reg||1
